      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems to be in avatars under ~0.9m\nThe fbt toggle in QM is also broken for me and just makes me into a pretzel. \nThe problem stopped happening yesterday (before update) but started again after restarting and updating. It just seems to fix itself for some people like it did for me but they usually have less problems with it.",
